{"agent_id":"pp3g-kifs-investigate-session-history-divergence-419-under-epic","agent_seq":3,"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:31:48.094035774Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"0b35f3d4-0eba-4cee-a61b-205c6778a36c","comment_uuid":"4b88e508-8f44-4900-b313-e2284bcc2ec8","author":"pp3g-kifs-investigate-session-history-divergence-419-under-epic","content":"Plan: Read-only DB forensics. [1] Copy opencode.db / opencode-fork-pp3g.db / opencode-local.db (+ -wal/-shm) to /tmp/opencode/w3/ BEFORE any query; originals never opened. [2] Dump sqlite_master schema of each copy; identify session/message/project tables and timestamp semantics. [3] Per DB per project key: session count + min/max timestamps; map keys to /home/claude-code/projects/ASES and .worktrees subdirs. [4] Locate pre-Aug-9 vs post-Aug-9 sessions across stores; discriminate hypotheses (a) pre-migration store read, (b) v2 project-key split, (c) fork-db/main-db split using data, not changelogs (changelog consulted only as corroboration via webfetch). [5] Determine opencode-local.db identity (schema fingerprint + last-write content) and why cold after Aug 18. Deliverable: findings + ranked root cause + fix options in comments with WHY/WHAT/HOW-CERTAIN/WHAT-NOT-TESTED per claim. Constraints honored: no repo file changes, no commits, no crosslink sync (per CONSTRAINTS line; contradiction with boilerplate sync instructions noted for operator), scratch only under /tmp/opencode/w3/.","created_at":"2026-08-23T18:31:48.086110509Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:5P0In62Vy+f5W70LFsnSXIcxGCYCn9lXy8xFYykiUP4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxSAAMdbb+YlemhsxAjiKxl34uM/C3uMkJNfJ812YnugAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAMohJ5L3QjHRexE/sEeQmgM6CZ1EXq+7ARu6Ke7BxhsULfkhHvGG2aXLJvB6HCq05w0l98WoslyagZb5vIBBlCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:5P0In62Vy+f5W70LFsnSXIcxGCYCn9lXy8xFYykiUP4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxSAAMdbb+YlemhsxAjiKxl34uM